# What the e3 story-statistics rule produces, in sha256sum format, paths relative to data/derived.
# e3_story_stats_verify checks a build against it.
#
# The file is plain text: a function of the deposit (pinned by results-e3.sha256), E2's
# unconstrained fronts the concatenation arm points at, and the refolds of `derna check`
# (pins/e3-PROVENANCE.md names the build the deposited ones were made with). It holds every number the paper's UTRs subsection quotes: the share of
# concatenation designs that are modular (84% are not), the proteins with a modular design per
# method and UTR pair, the windows of DERNA2's search by state, and the instance of the main figure
# (P26436 on the BNT UTRs at CAI >= 0.9), including the window that contains the cutoff and the
# comparison over every instance with a modular DERNA2 design there.
#
# Cut 2026-11-04: 30 proteins of 163 to 787 residues on five UTR pairs, 150 cells.
b7c895c57cacdcd1b8f90a5624fbd15109145510e9b360b7eb0182cc753c7bb7  e3/story_stats.txt
